WEBVTT

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:09.236
Choose Sponsors in the side menu.

00:00:09.486 --> 00:00:15.486
Check that Sponsors are off. Viewers
see nothing. shows beside the switch.

00:00:16.014 --> 00:00:19.477
Click Show sponsors on the site.

00:00:19.727 --> 00:00:23.793
Type "your password" in the Password box.

00:00:24.043 --> 00:00:26.694
Click Confirm.

00:00:26.944 --> 00:00:31.747
Check that Sponsors are on.
shows beside the switch.

00:00:31.997 --> 00:00:35.460
Click Show sponsors on the site.

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:39.775
Type "your password" in the Password box.

00:00:40.025 --> 00:00:42.676
Click Confirm.

00:00:42.926 --> 00:00:48.399
Check that Sponsors are off.
Viewers see nothing. shows again.
